        "## 2. Data\n",
        "Free daily data from Yahoo Finance via `yfinance`, cached to CSV so the notebook reruns without re-downloading.\n",
        "\n",
        "| Series | Ticker | Use |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| Nifty 50 | `^NSEI` | Core index, returns, volatility |\n",
        "| Bank Nifty | `^NSEBANK` | Financials' relative strength |\n",
        "| India VIX | `^INDIAVIX` | Implied volatility |\n",
        "| USD/INR | `INR=X` | Currency stress (FII-flow proxy) |\n",
        "| Gold ETF | `GOLDBEES.NS` | Optional defensive asset |\n",
        "| Sector indices | `^CNXIT`, `^CNXFMCG`, … | Sector dispersion |\n",
        "| ~45 large caps | `RELIANCE.NS`, … | Market breadth |\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Survivorship note:** the breadth universe is a *current* large-cap list, not historical Nifty 50 membership. This is a known limitation, stated again in Section 12."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 3,
      "id": "a6e731af",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "a6e731af"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "CORE = {\"NIFTY\": \"^NSEI\", \"BANKNIFTY\": \"^NSEBANK\", \"INDIAVIX\": \"^INDIAVIX\",\n",
        "        \"USDINR\": \"INR=X\", \"GOLD\": \"GOLDBEES.NS\"}\n",
        "SECTORS = {\"IT\": \"^CNXIT\", \"FMCG\": \"^CNXFMCG\", \"PHARMA\": \"^CNXPHARMA\", \"AUTO\": \"^CNXAUTO\",\n",
        "           \"METAL\": \"^CNXMETAL\", \"REALTY\": \"^CNXREALTY\", \"ENERGY\": \"^CNXENERGY\", \"MEDIA\": \"^CNXMEDIA\"}\n",
        "# Large caps with long, stable ticker histories (approximation of Nifty 50 for breadth)\n",
        "CONSTITUENTS = [s + \".NS\" for s in (\n",
        "    \"RELIANCE HDFCBANK ICICIBANK INFY TCS BHARTIARTL ITC LT SBIN AXISBANK \"\n",
        "    \"KOTAKBANK HINDUNILVR BAJFINANCE M&M MARUTI SUNPHARMA HCLTECH NTPC TITAN ULTRACEMCO POWERGRID \"\n",
        "    \"ASIANPAINT TATASTEEL BAJAJFINSV ADANIPORTS ONGC COALINDIA NESTLEIND JSWSTEEL GRASIM TECHM WIPRO \"\n",
        "    \"HINDALCO ADANIENT CIPLA DRREDDY EICHERMOT APOLLOHOSP TRENT BEL SHRIRAMFIN BAJAJ-AUTO HEROMOTOCO \"\n",
        "    \"TATACONSUM INDUSINDBK BPCL BRITANNIA\").split()]\n",
        "\n",
        "def fetch_close(ticker):\n",
        "    # Daily adjusted close for one ticker, cached to CSV. Returns None if unavailable.\n",
        "    import yfinance as yf\n",
        "    os.makedirs(DATA_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "    path = os.path.join(DATA_DIR, ticker.replace(\"^\", \"_\").replace(\"=\", \"_\").replace(\"&\", \"_\") + \".csv\")\n",
        "    if os.path.exists(path):\n",
        "        s = pd.read_csv(path, index_col=0, parse_dates=True).iloc[:, 0]\n",
        "        return s if len(s) else None\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        df = yf.Ticker(ticker).history(start=START, end=END, auto_adjust=True)\n",
        "    except Exception as e:\n",
        "        print(f\"  failed {ticker}: {e}\"); return None\n",
        "    if df is None or df.empty:\n",
        "        print(f\"  no data {ticker}\"); return None\n",
        "    s = df[\"Close\"].copy()\n",
        "    if s.index.tz is not None:\n",
        "        s.index = s.index.tz_localize(None)\n",
        "    s.index = s.index.normalize()\n",
        "    s = s[~s.index.duplicated(keep=\"last\")].rename(ticker)\n",
        "    s.to_csv(path)\n",
        "    time.sleep(0.3)   # be polite to the API\n",
        "    return s"
      ]
    },
