      "source": [
        "## 3. Features (all strictly trailing)\n",
        "\n",
        "| Group | Feature | Intuition |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| Base | `ret5` – 5-day log return | Direction |\n",
        "| Base | `log_rv21` – log 21-day realised vol | Stress level (used to order HMM states) |\n",
        "| VIX | `log_vix`, `vix_chg5` | Option-implied fear and how fast it is rising |\n",
        "| Breadth | `breadth50` – share of large caps above their 50-DMA | Are falls broad or narrow? |\n",
        "| Breadth | `sector_disp` – cross-sector std of 21-day returns | Rotation / dislocation |\n",
        "| Macro | `usdinr21` – 21-day USD/INR change | Rupee stress, foreign outflows |\n",
        "| Macro | `bank_rel21` – Bank Nifty minus Nifty, 21 days | Financials often crack first |\n",
        "\n",
        "Drawdown is deliberately **not** a feature, because the stress episodes used for evaluation are defined by drawdowns — using it would make the evaluation circular."
      ]
    },
