        "## 7. Early-warning evaluation (RQ3)\n",
        "For every ≥10% drawdown whose peak falls in the out-of-sample period:\n",
        "- **Lag:** trading days from the peak to the first alarm.\n",
        "- **Nifty fall at alarm:** how far the market had already fallen when the alarm fired.\n",
        "- **Missed:** no alarm between the peak and the trough.\n",
        "\n",
        "**False alarms per year** count alarm onsets that start outside every episode window (from 10 days before a peak to its trough)."
      ]
    },
